  "contentHtml": "<p>주기율표 도장 만들기입니다^^</p><p>이런거 있으면 어떨까? 하고 한번 만들어 보려고 도안을 했어요.</p><p>디자인은 다양하게? 빈칸을 넣을수도 있고^^ 학습용으로 좀 크게 만들려고요. (88*51)</p><p>마음에 드는 버전으로 수정하여 사용하시도록 미리캔버스 템플릿 링크를 공유하여 드릴께요~</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a7d344b5e96d22016668b6560ddc7d052f0bd0b8\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" height=\"307\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a7d344b5e96d22016668b6560ddc7d052f0bd0b8\" data-origin-width=\"639\" data-origin-height=\"383\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/04339871848093675e8e73aad3cdf2dcd093aa49\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"506\" height=\"301\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/04339871848093675e8e73aad3cdf2dcd093aa49\" data-origin-width=\"545\" data-origin-height=\"324\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>요건 작은 도장으로 만들었어요. 립스틱과 사이즈 비교용으로 찍어봤어요~ (전화영선생님 블로그에서 보고 만들어봤습니다)</p><p>크게 학습용 생각했었지만, 막상 요놈 작은거 만들었더니 만족합니다.ㅋ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6ccb15fda53197432aa5f66ccd613282f754781b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"534\" height=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6ccb15fda53197432aa5f66ccd613282f754781b\" data-origin-width=\"1411\" data-origin-height=\"1056\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>템플릿 링크입니다!</p><p><a href=\"https://www.miricanvas.com/v/148hg17?mode=templateshare\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.miricanvas.com/v/148hg17?mode=templateshare</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"주기율표도장만들기기\" data-og-description=\" \" data-og-host=\"www.miricanvas.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.miricanvas.com/v/148hg17?mode=templateshare\" data-og-url=\"https://www.miricanvas.com/v/148hg17?mode=templateshare\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cq2yBn/hyYnedbna1/boB95sWwUEZudRR7k2QcD0/img.jpg?width=800&amp;height=450&amp;face=0_0_800_450,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bWO5Zk/hyYjBumHBm/LtflGL4OsSnnnyr8iX6WLk/img.jpg?width=800&amp;height=450&amp;face=0_0_800_450\"><a href=\"https://www.miricanvas.com/v/148hg17?mode=templateshare\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.miricanvas.com/v/148hg17?mode=templateshare\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cq2yBn/hyYnedbna1/boB95sWwUEZudRR7k2QcD0/img.jpg?width=800&amp;height=450&amp;face=0_0_800_450,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bWO5Zk/hyYjBumHBm/LtflGL4OsSnnnyr8iX6WLk/img.jpg?width=800&amp;height=450&amp;face=0_0_800_450\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">주기율표도장만들기기</p><p class=\"og-desc\"> </p><p class=\"og-host\">www.miricanvas.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>아 이걸 도장으로 어떻게 만드느냐?&#160;</p><p>저는 11번가 도장마트 이용했습니다. <span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>여기와 개인적으로는 아무런아무런 관계가 없습니당</b></span></p><p><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">더 좋은 곳 있으시면 댓글로 달아 주시면 만들려는 선생님께 더 도움이 되겠지용</span></b></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">미리캔버스에서 원하는 모양으로 디자인하신후에 </span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">그 페이지만 pdf로 내려받으셔서 </span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">여기에 주문할 때 메일로 도안을 보내시면 됩니다.</span></b></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>작년에 출결도장을 여기서 큰 사이즈로 주문하여 잘 사용했기에...</p><p>한번 해본곳이라 여기에 주문넣어봤는데 주문넣은날 만들어 바로 발송하여 다음날 받았어요.&#160;</p><p>&#160;(며칠 걸린다고 나와있지만요.)</p><p><a href=\"https://www.11st.co.kr/products/585483745?&amp;xfrom=&amp;xzone=\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.11st.co.kr/products/585483745?&amp;xfrom=&amp;xzone=</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"[11번가] 도장마트 만년스탬프 사업자 명판 스템프 고무인 도장 자동\" data-og-description=\"문구/사무용품&gt;사무용품&gt;도장/인주&gt;만년도장, 가격 : 4,700원\" data-og-host=\"www.11st.co.kr\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.11st.co.kr/products/585483745?&amp;xfrom=&amp;xzone=\" data-og-url=\"https://www.11st.co.kr/products/585483745?xfrom=&amp;xzone=\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/HUmXy/hyYmHT0O2i/VK5oOkssuk3fZRMuuk61ck/img.jpg?width=569&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_569_600,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bbQEeH/hyYjMQbACF/OhLBvre4ouBWwYm1qEhJA1/img.jpg?width=569&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_569_600,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bp1lXY/hyYncGrcXv/EIhsMZFDten8SxVDEjpHVk/img.jpg?width=600&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_600_600\"><a href=\"https://www.11st.co.kr/products/585483745?&amp;xfrom=&amp;xzone=\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.11st.co.kr/products/585483745?&amp;xfrom=&amp;xzone=\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/HUmXy/hyYmHT0O2i/VK5oOkssuk3fZRMuuk61ck/img.jpg?width=569&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_569_600,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bbQEeH/hyYjMQbACF/OhLBvre4ouBWwYm1qEhJA1/img.jpg?width=569&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_569_600,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bp1lXY/hyYncGrcXv/EIhsMZFDten8SxVDEjpHVk/img.jpg?width=600&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_600_600\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">[11번가] 도장마트 만년스탬프 사업자 명판 스템프 고무인 도장 자동</p><p class=\"og-desc\">문구/사무용품&gt;사무용품&gt;도장/인주&gt;만년도장, 가격 : 4,700원</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.11st.co.kr</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>아래 작은 도장은 요 사이즈로 선택했고요. 6700원인데 배송비가 3000원 있어요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9885d42ead082b84f2a957f94a1b833ea6b3cdd4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9885d42ead082b84f2a957f94a1b833ea6b3cdd4\" data-origin-width=\"791\" data-origin-height=\"356\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>제일 큰 사이즈는 이건데, 8700원입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/413b03e08b163898465d8694c19fa25c7beafe56\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/413b03e08b163898465d8694c19fa25c7beafe56\" data-origin-width=\"788\" data-origin-height=\"387\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
